      "message": "I\u0027m going to send separate CLs for every core. This one is for cortex-m.\n\nIf we want to support returning value from some atomic operations, just as I wrote in the commit message, I think it is better to use builtin functions(as it is done in Zephyr) rather than changing ATOMIC_OP macro. Maybe there was a reason not to use those functions at the beginning of the project, please let me know.\n\nI also not sure if it is better not to change atomic_clear_bit, when return value is not needed so ATOMIC_OP can be used or to be consistent use the builtin here as well.\n\nI would like to know your opinion on this.",
